"A payment with another method is already in progress on this order. Finish or cancel it first."
msgstr ""
"En betaling med en anden metode er allerede i gang for denne ordre. Færdiggør eller annullér den først."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:86
